《浪子阿发》 MV — credits

Song
  《浪子阿发》 from the album 《反婚宇宙》: the user's own work (music, lyrics, recording). Used as the whole soundtrack,
  unchanged apart from loudness normalisation to -14 LUFS at the final mux. No other audio is in the film.

Picture
  Every drawing, background and effect is generated by the code in this folder (Canvas 2D + a WebGL2 tape/CRT pass).
  No stock art, no generated video, no photographs.

Engine code adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar style library (style "80s Cel Anime", folder cel-anime-80s)
  cel.js, fx.js, post.js: copied from the style's demo engine; stage.js, people.js, bike.js build on its techniques.
  Used under that library's licence.

