Timing data
  Lyric timings: faster-whisper large-v3 word timestamps (timing only), aligned by hand to the official lyric sheet (tools/align.py).
  Beat grid: librosa beat tracking.

All characters, places, signs and the story are original; no real people, brands or logos appear.
